Error [jet.MisplacedParameterSeparator]: `/` marks an empty parameter zone
  --> tests/ui/param_zone_empty_positional.jet:1:13
    |
  1 | connect: fn(/, host: String) -> String { host }
    |             ^
 Why: A positional-only zone needs at least one parameter before the `/`
 Fix: Write the positional-only parameters before `/`, or remove the `/`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0763
